01:17:58,390 --> 01:18:02,950
So you see that as
you go towards 0 here,

990
01:18:02,950 --> 01:18:05,930
this number here goes
to minus infinity.

991
01:18:05,930 --> 01:18:08,630
So this here goes to infinity.

992
01:18:08,630 --> 01:18:11,350
So it doesn't converge.

993
01:18:11,350 --> 01:18:13,850
So the answer is no.

994
01:18:19,936 --> 01:18:25,670
