996
01:18:28,150 --> 01:18:29,720
So this is arc length.

997
01:18:33,650 --> 01:18:38,200
So suppose you take
a curve in the plane.

998
01:18:44,690 --> 01:18:48,660
So suppose that I have
a curve in the plane.

999
01:18:56,490 --> 01:19:00,290
