1005
01:19:15,810 --> 01:19:22,630
And I'm assuming that f
and g are differentiable.

1006
01:19:25,210 --> 01:19:31,130
And the derivative
here are continuous.

1007
01:19:33,870 --> 01:19:35,950
So suppose I have such a curve.

1008
01:19:35,950 --> 01:19:41,590
And s here is running in
an interval from a to b.

1009
01:19:41,590 --> 01:19:45,950
Then the length of the
curve is, by definition,

1010
